lease was automatically created by [GitHub Actions](./.github/workflows/release.yml).\n\nIf you would like to verify that the binary you have downloaded was built from the source code in this repository, you can compute a checksum of the zipped tarball and compare it to the checksums that are included as release artifacts.\n\nBinaries built for MacOS are signed, notarized, and automatically verified with [Gatekeeper](https://support.apple.com/guide/deployment-reference-macos/using-gatekeeper-apd02b925e38/web).","mentions_count":1}
